  "The white-key mode-walking method fails specifically because it never changes the pitch collection \u2014 every mode you play is still built from C major's notes, so the ear just hears C major with a different starting point rather than a distinct color; keeping the root fixed and changing the key signature is what actually isolates each mode's sound.",
